---
layout: base.njk
pageTitle: "Things to Do in Antalya"
pageDescription: "Ancient theatres, waterfalls, turquoise beaches and a walled Roman-era old town — the best things to do in Antalya, Turkey."
pageUrl: "/things-to-do/"
ogImage: "/images/editorial/aspendos-theatre.jpg"
permalink: "/things-to-do/index.html"
schema:
  "@context": "https://schema.org"
  "@type": "CollectionPage"
  name: "Things to Do in Antalya"
  url: "https://travel-antalya.com/things-to-do/"
eleventyExcludeFromCollections: true
---
{% from 'ui.njk' import icon, pic, credit, card, pageHero, sectionHead %}
{% set items = collections.thingsToDo %}
{{ pageHero(editorialPhotos | photoById('aspendos-theatre'), 'Explore', 'Things to do in Antalya', 'Ruins, waterfalls & turquoise coves', [{label: 'Things to do'}]) }}

<section class="intro-band" aria-label="About things to do in Antalya">
  <div class="container">
    <div class="intro-card" data-readmore>
      <div class="intro-text" id="todo-intro">
        <p>In Antalya the possibilities go far beyond the beach. Walk a 2,000-year-old colonnaded street in <a href="/things-to-do/perge-ancient-city/">Perge</a>, hear the acoustics of <a href="/things-to-do/aspendos-theatre/">Aspendos</a>, then cool off under the <a href="/things-to-do/duden-waterfalls/">Düden Waterfalls</a> as they drop straight into the sea.</p>
        <p>Wander the lanes of <a href="/things-to-do/kaleici-old-town/">Kaleiçi</a>, raft through <a href="/things-to-do/koprulu-canyon/">Köprülü Canyon</a>, ride the <a href="/things-to-do/tahtali-olympos-cable-car/">Tahtalı cable car</a> above the clouds or watch the eternal flames of the <a href="/things-to-do/olympos-and-the-chimaera-flames/">Chimaera</a> after dark.</p>
        <p>Opening hours, tickets and seasonal access change — check the official source for each site before you set off.</p>
      </div>
      <button type="button" class="readmore-btn" aria-expanded="false" aria-controls="todo-intro" hidden>Read more</button>
    </div>
  </div>
</section>

<section class="section" aria-labelledby="todo-all">
  <div class="container">
    {{ sectionHead('Follow your curiosity', 'Explore things to do', '', '', 'todo-all') }}
    {% set cats = items | uniqueValues('category') %}
    <ul class="chips" style="margin:-12px 0 32px">{% for c in cats %}<li>{{ icon({'Ancient Ruins': 'landmark', 'Nature': 'mountain', 'Beaches': 'waves', 'Adventure': 'compass', 'Old Town': 'map', 'Museums': 'landmark', 'Parks & Gardens': 'sun'}[c] or 'star') }}<span>{{ c }}</span></li>{% endfor %}</ul>
    <div class="card-grid cols-3">
      {% for item in items %}{% set ph = item.data | cardPhoto(editorialPhotos) %}
      {{ card('/things-to-do/' + (item.data.title | slugify) + '/', ph, item.data.title, item.data.excerpt | shorten(120), item.data.category, ('Top pick' if item.data.featured else ''), '', '(max-width: 700px) 92vw, 32vw') }}
      {% endfor %}
    </div>
  </div>
</section>

{% set ph1 = editorialPhotos | photoById('kaputas-beach') %}
<section class="section-tight" aria-labelledby="beach-title">
  <div class="container">
    <div class="split split-navy">
      <div class="split-media">
        {{ pic(ph1.src, ph1.alt, '(max-width: 860px) 100vw, 55vw', false, ph1.width, ph1.height) }}
        <svg class="blob" viewBox="0 0 110 600" preserveAspectRatio="none" aria-hidden="true"><path fill="currentColor" d="M110 0H60C20 80 70 160 40 250S0 420 50 500 70 600 70 600h40Z"/></svg>
        {{ credit(ph1) }}
      </div>
      <div class="split-copy">
        <p class="eyebrow">Beach days</p>
        <h2 id="beach-title">Turquoise coves worth the drive</h2>
        <p>From the city beach at Konyaaltı to the cliff-framed cove at Kaputaş.</p>
        <div class="button-row"><a class="btn btn-light" href="/blog/kaputas-beach-travel-antalya/">Kaputaş guide</a><a class="btn btn-ghost-light" href="/things-to-do/konyaalti-beach/">Konyaaltı Beach</a></div>
      </div>
    </div>
  </div>
</section>

<section class="section section-sand" aria-labelledby="stay-near">
  <div class="container">
    {{ sectionHead('Places to stay', 'Hotels near the sights', '/hotels/', 'All hotels', 'stay-near') }}
    <div class="card-grid">
      {% for h in collections.hotels | withOwnPhotos(editorialPhotos, 8) | take(4) %}{% set ph = h.data | cardPhoto(editorialPhotos) %}
      {{ card('/hotels/' + (h.data.slug or (h.data.title | slugify)) + '/', ph, h.data.title, '', h.data.neighborhood) }}
      {% endfor %}
    </div>
  </div>
</section>
